<title>UK: CWS predator group says complies with court order.</title>
<headline>CWS predator group says complies with court order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Group, entrepreneur Andrew Regan's special bidding vehicle currently stalking Britain's Co-operative Wholesale Society (CWS) said on Wednesday it had complied with a High Court order to return confidential information to the CWS.</p>
<p>&quot;That information had been made available voluntarily to Galileo by an employee of CWS,&quot; Galileo said. It is not seeking court permission to publish its bid proposal but is writing to CWS directors to explain its position and ask them to consider if it would be better for members to hear its plans rather than continue with legal action.</p>
</text>
